<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Nuestros Recuerdos 📸 | Sanrio Theme</title>
        <style>
            /* ==========================================================================
       VARIABLES Y REGLAS BÁSICAS
       ========================================================================== */
            :root {
                --bg-color: #fdf0f4;
                --hk-pink: #ffb7c5;
                --hk-dark-pink: #f48fb1;
                --hk-red: #ff5252;
                --choco-brown: #5d4037;
                --choco-dark: #3e2723;
                --choco-orange: #ffab40;
                --pastel-yellow: #fff9c4;
                --pastel-blue: #e1f5fe;
                --text-main: #4a3e3d;
                --card-bg: #ffffff;
                --font-family:
                    "Comic Sans MS", "Chalkboard SE", "Comic Neue", cursive,
                    sans-serif;
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }

            body {
                background-color: var(--bg-color);
                color: var(--text-main);
                font-family: var(--font-family);
                min-height: 100vh;
                padding: 20px 15px 50px 15px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                background-image:
                    radial-gradient(var(--hk-pink) 15%, transparent 16%),
                    radial-gradient(var(--choco-orange) 15%, transparent 16%);
                background-size: 60px 60px;
                background-position:
                    0 0,
                    30px 30px;
                overflow-x: hidden;
                position: relative;
            }

            /* ==========================================================================
       ELEMENTOS DE NAVEGACIÓN Y ENCABEZADO
       ========================================================================== */
            .nav-container {
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 900px;
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                margin-bottom: 30px;
                gap: 10px;
                z-index: 10;
            }

            .btn-nav {
                background-color: var(--card-bg);
                color: var(--choco-brown);
                border: 3px solid var(--hk-pink);
                padding: 10px 20px;
                border-radius: 25px;
                font-family: inherit;
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 0.95rem;
                cursor: pointer;
                text-decoration: none;
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
                transition: all 0.2s ease;
            }

            .btn-nav:hover {
                transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);
                background-color: var(--hk-pink);
                color: white;
                border-color: var(--hk-dark-pink);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(244, 143, 177, 0.4);
            }

            .header-box {
                background: var(--card-bg);
                border: 4px dashed var(--hk-dark-pink);
                border-radius: 30px;
                padding: 25px 30px;
                text-align: center;
                max-width: 700px;
                width: 100%;
                margin-bottom: 40px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
                position: relative;
            }

            .header-box h1 {
                color: var(--choco-brown);
                font-size: 2.2rem;
                margin-bottom: 10px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 10px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }

            .header-box p {
                color: #6d5d5b;
                font-size: 1.05rem;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }

            .header-avatar {
                width: 50px;
                height: 50px;
                object-fit: contain;
                vertical-align: middle;
            }

            /* ==========================================================================
    GRID DE 4 RECUERDOS (POLAROIDS)
       ========================================================================== */
            .memories-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                gap: 40px 30px;
                width: 100%;
                max-width: 850px;
                margin: 0 auto 50px auto;
                z-index: 5;
            }

            @media (max-width: 680px) {
                .memories-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                    max-width: 400px;
                }
            }

            .polaroid-card {
                background: var(--card-bg);
                padding: 18px 18px 25px 18px;
                border-radius: 4px;
                box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
                position: relative;
                transition:
                    transform 0.3s ease,
                    box-shadow 0.3s ease;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            /* Rotaciones alternadas tipo Polaroid real */
            .polaroid-card:nth-child(1) {
                transform: rotate(-2.5deg);
            }
            .polaroid-card:nth-child(2) {
                transform: rotate(2deg);
            }
            .polaroid-card:nth-child(3) {
                transform: rotate(1.8deg);
            }
            .polaroid-card:nth-child(4) {
                transform: rotate(-2deg);
            }

            .polaroid-card:hover {
                transform: scale(1.04) rotate(0deg) !important;
                z-index: 20;
                box-shadow: 0 18px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            }

            /* Cintas Adhesivas (Washi Tape) */
            .washi-tape {
                position: absolute;
                top: -15px;
                width: 100px;
                height: 28px;
                opacity: 0.85;
                z-index: 2;
            }

            .washi-pink {
                background: rgba(255, 183, 197, 0.7);
                border-left: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
                border-right: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
                transform: rotate(-3deg);
            }

            .washi-yellow {
                background: rgba(255, 249, 196, 0.8);
                border-left: 2px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
                border-right: 2px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
                transform: rotate(4deg);
            }

            /* Marco Contenedor de la Imagen */
            .photo-frame {
                width: 100%;
                aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
                background-color: #f7f3f5;
                border: 2px dashed var(--hk-pink);
                border-radius: 8px;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                overflow: hidden;
                position: relative;
                margin-bottom: 18px;
            }

            /* Si quieres poner tu foto, la etiqueta <img> usará esta clase */
            .photo-frame img {
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
                display: block;
            }

            .photo-placeholder-content {
                text-align: center;
                padding: 15px;
                color: #9e8e8c;
            }

            .photo-placeholder-icon {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
                display: block;
                opacity: 0.7;
            }

            .photo-placeholder-text {
                font-size: 0.85rem;
                font-weight: bold;
                color: var(--choco-brown);
            }

            /* Pie de foto estilo Polaroid */
            .polaroid-caption {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .polaroid-title {
                font-size: 1.15rem;
                color: var(--choco-brown);
                font-weight: bold;
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }

            .polaroid-date {
                display: inline-block;
                background: var(--pastel-yellow);
                color: var(--choco-dark);
                font-size: 0.75rem;
                padding: 3px 10px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                font-weight: bold;
                margin-bottom: 8px;
                border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            }

            .polaroid-note {
                font-size: 0.88rem;
                color: #6a5a58;
                line-height: 1.4;
                font-style: italic;
            }

            /* Adornos Sanrio en las esquinas */
            .corner-badge {
                position: absolute;
                bottom: 10px;
                right: 10px;
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                object-fit: contain;
                pointer-events: none;
            }

            /* ==========================================================================
    FOOTER
       ========================================================================== */
            .footer {
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 20px;
                padding: 15px;
                color: var(--choco-brown);
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
                border-radius: 20px;
                backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <!-- NAVEGACIÓN SUPERIOR -->
        <nav class="nav-container">
            <a href="./index.html" class="btn-nav">
                <span>←</span> Inicio
            </a>
            <a href="./canciones.html" class="btn-nav">
                🎵 Canciones <span>→</span>
            </a>
        </nav>

        <!-- ENCABEZADO -->
        <header class="header-box">
            <h1>
                Nuestros 4 Momentos
            </h1>
            <p>
                Cuatro fotos especiales de nosotros guardadas con mucho amor en
                mi corazon. 💕
            </p>
        </header>

        <!-- CONTENEDOR DE LOS 4 RECUERDOS -->
        <main class="memories-grid">
            <!-- RECUERDO 1 -->
            <article class="polaroid-card">
                <div class="washi-tape washi-pink"></div>
                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <!-- 
        INSTRUCCIONES: Para colocar tu foto, borra el div .photo-placeholder-content 
        y pon tu imagen así:
        <img src="/ruta-de-tu-foto1.jpg" alt="Nuestro Primer Momento" />
        -->
                    <img src="src/assets/recuerdo3.jpg" alt="Nuestro Primer Momento">
                </div>

                <div class="polaroid-caption">
                    <span class="polaroid-date">📅 Fecha especial</span>
                    <h2 class="polaroid-title">Cuando viniste a mi Cumpleaños</h2>
                    <p class="polaroid-note">
                        "El día que me perdi en tus ojos."
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- RECUERDO 2 -->
            <article class="polaroid-card">
                <div class="washi-tape washi-yellow"></div>

                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <!-- Coloca aquí tu imagen 2 -->
                    <img src="src/assets/recuerdo2.jpg" alt="Salida">
                </div>

                <div class="polaroid-caption">
                    <span class="polaroid-date">📅 Cita inolvidable</span>
                    <h2 class="polaroid-title">Una Salida Especial</h2>
                    <p class="polaroid-note">
                        "Risas, besos y tu carita se quedaron mi mente hasta hoy."
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>

            <!-- RECUERDO 3 -->
            <article class="polaroid-card">
                <div class="washi-tape washi-yellow"></div>

                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <!-- Coloca aquí tu imagen 3 -->
                    <img src="src/assets/recuerdo4.jpg" alt="Favorito">
                </div>

                <div class="polaroid-caption">
                    <span class="polaroid-date">📅 Día favorito</span>
                    <h2 class="polaroid-title">Tu Sonrisa Favorita</h2>
                    <p class="polaroid-note">
                        "Verte feliz es lo único que necesito para tener un buen
                        día."
                    </p>
                </div>


            </article>

            <!-- RECUERDO 4 -->
            <article class="polaroid-card">
                <div class="washi-tape washi-pink"></div>

                <div class="photo-frame">
                    <!-- Coloca aquí tu imagen 4 -->
                    <img src="src/assets/recuerdo1.jpg" alt="">
                </div>

                <div class="polaroid-caption">
                    <span class="polaroid-date">📅 Para Siempre</span>
                    <h2 class="polaroid-title">Juntos Tú y Yo</h2>
                    <p class="polaroid-note">
                        "Creando más recuerdos hermosos cada día que pasa."
                    </p>
                </div>

            </article>
        </main>

        <footer class="footer">
            Hecho con mucho amor y detalle 🎀
        </footer>
    </body>
</html>
